  "raw_label": "1",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Angadi Jampaiah vs The State Of Telangana And 2 Others on 10 November, 2022 Bench: A.Abhishek Reddy, Juvvadi Sridevi The Hon'Ble Sri Justice A.Abhishek Reddy And The Hon'Ble Smt Justice Juvvadi Sridevi Writ Petition No.35137 of 2022 Order:",
    "facts": "The case of the petitioner is that based on two crimes viz., Crime No.130/2022 of Bhongiri Rural Police Station registered for the offences under Sections 457, 380 and 411 I.P.C., and Crime No.135/2022 of Valigonda Police Station registered for the offences under Sections 356 and 379 I.P.C, the respondent No.2 has passed the impugned detention order dated 11.08.2022. The detenue is Accused No.3 in Crime No.130/2022 and Accused No.2 in Crime No.135 of 2022. It is further stated that the detention orders passed against the Accused Nos.1 and 2 in Crime No.130/2022 were already [LEAKAGE_MASK] by this Court vide orders passed in W.P.No.32045 of 2022 and W.P.No.34487 of 2022, dated 12.09.2022 and 26.10.2022 respectively, and ultimately, prayed to [LEAKAGE_MASK] the impugned detention order and the consequential confirmation order.",
